# --- Nexus build output -----------------------------------------------
# EVERYTHING the build produces funnels through one of these three --
# see docs/BUILD_LAYOUT.md. `rm -rf build kernel/build userland/build`
# (the last two only exist if you ran `make` standalone inside those
# subdirs instead of from the top) always gets you back to a clean
# checkout; nothing else in the tree is ever a build artifact.
/build/
/kernel/build/
/userland/build/

# Generated copies of the shared ABI headers (see abi/ -- the single
# canonical source -- and scripts/sync-abi.sh, which regenerates these
# on every build). Never hand-edit these two paths.
/kernel/src/abi/*.h
/userland/include/*.h

.DS_Store
*.swp
*.swo
compile_commands.json
*.img
